OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer demoted for dental
OL,4,Aappointment lie
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who lied to his
OL,7,Fsupervisor about taking time off for a
OL,8,Fdentist appointment and emailed
OL,9,Fsensitive information to his personal
OL,10,Femail has been demoted.
OL,12,FFollowing a hearing at Dorset Police
OL,13,Fheadquarters in Winfrith on Tuesday,
OL,14,FDet Seg William Pearce was found to
OL,15,Fhave committed gross misconduct.
OL,17,FThe force said Pearce had been
OL,18,Fdescribed as "an exceptionally
OL,19,Fdedicated and committed officer" in a
OL,20,F"unique and specialist investigative
OL,21,Frole".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
