OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer demoted for dental
OL,4,Aappointment lie
OL,5,
OL,6,FHearing chair Assistant Chief Constable
OL,7,FMark Callaghan said Pearce, who had
OL,8,Fcontinued to perform within the role,
OL,9,Fwas "respected and trusted" and
OL,10,Fdemotion had been "the most suitable
OL,11,Foutcome".
